  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "アカデミー指定の　ピクニック用　カップ。飲み口の　きめ細やかさは　こだわりの作りで　学校外でも　人気が　高い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "아카데미 지정 피크닉용 컵. 입이 닿는 부분이 섬세하게 만들어져서 학교 밖에서도 인기가 많다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "學院指定的野餐用水杯。精心雕琢而成的細緻杯口連校外人士也趨之若鶩。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une tasse fournie par l’académie pour les pique-niques. Le soin apporté à ses rebords la rend populaire parmi les élèves, mais aussi en dehors de l’école.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die offizielle Akademie-Tasse für Picknicks. Dank des eigenwilligen Designs ihres fein gearbeiteten Randes ist sie nicht nur bei Akademieschülern sehr beliebt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La taza de pícnic oficial de la academia. El borde resulta especialmente cómodo a la hora de beber, por lo que es popular incluso entre aquellos que no son alumnos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tazza da picnic con il design regolamentare dell’accademia. Il bordo di fattura sopraffina la rende molto popolare anche al di fuori della scuola.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The academy’s standard-issue cup for picnicking. The careful design of its mouth makes it popular both inside and outside the academy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "アカデミー指定の　ピクニック用　カップ。飲み口の　きめ細やかさは　こだわりの作りで　学校外でも　人気が　高い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "学院指定的野餐用杯。杯口造型经过精雕细琢，在学校内外都很有人气。",
